          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": " I am no longer able to replicated the problem \"SyntaxError: Unexpected end of JSON input\" from the HTML UI by following the steps at ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2055?focusedCommentId=50536&page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-50536"
