            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2055?focusedCommentId=50536&page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-50536",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "now. However, I am still able to replicate it with the copy I cloned earlier by Jun. 26th by stopping jetty, deleting the data in \"fcrepo4-data\" and restart jetty with \"mvn jetty:run -pl fcrepo-webapp\". It's something interesting! I think we can close the ticket now. What do you think?",
