     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Yeah, from my end it's not easy to understand how this \"SyntaxError: Unexpected end of JSON input\" from the HTML UI be cleared by other commits, since I can't replicate the error with commits on and after Jun 27 (",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/abd48c283c8bc8f96eb250ab1424f686918a854d)"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/abd48c283c8bc8f96eb250ab1424f686918a854d)",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": ". However, I am still able to replicate it with the commit at Jun 9 (",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/dcf8356152e083ff4af4a51e2720eb97ca83bc36),"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/dcf8356152e083ff4af4a51e2720eb97ca83bc36),",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " which is my branch was basing on previously. Here is the branch that I can replicate the problem: ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/lsitu/fcrepo4/tree/feature/html-ui-error"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/lsitu/fcrepo4/tree/feature/html-ui-error",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " . Maybe it will help us understand the error a little bit if you can replicate the error with it?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
