      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Yeah, from my end it's not easy to understand how this \"SyntaxError: Unexpected end of JSON input\" from the HTML UI be cleared by other commits, since I can't replicate the error with commits on and after Jun 27 (<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/abd48c283c8bc8f96eb250ab1424f686918a854d\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/abd48c283c8bc8f96eb250ab1424f686918a854d</a>). However, I am still able to replicate it with the commit at Jun 9 (<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/dcf8356152e083ff4af4a51e2720eb97ca83bc36\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/dcf8356152e083ff4af4a51e2720eb97ca83bc36</a>), which is my branch was basing on previously. Here is the branch that I can replicate the problem: <a href=\"https://github.com/lsitu/fcrepo4/tree/feature/html-ui-error\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/lsitu/fcrepo4/tree/feature/html-ui-error</a> . Maybe it will help us understand the error a little bit if you can replicate the error with it?</p>",
