  "description": "<p>This task is to replicate and resolve the issue identified by the test steps detailed in the following comments:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2055?focusedCommentId=50536&amp;page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-50536\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2055?focusedCommentId=50536&amp;page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-50536</a></p>\n\n<p>Under certain circumstances, the HTML UI responds with: \"SyntaxError: Unexpected end of JSON input\" when browsing through HTML resources.</p>\n\n<p>The issue appears to be related to the fact that HEAD operations respond with application/ld+json that is unparseable... which is not surprising, since HEAD should have an empty body.</p>",
